            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are overflowing</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You conduct the magic in your internal nexus to coat your weapon or unarmed strike, empowering it with magical energy for a devastating attack. Make a melee Strike. If the Strike hits, you deal an additional @Damage[1d4[force]] damage. At 10th level, the additional damage increases to @Damage[2d4[force]] damage. At 18th level, the additional damage increases to @Damage[3d4[force]] damage. You are no longer overflowing.</p>"
